<title>HUNGARY: ZWACK BOOSTS PROFIT IN JAN-SEPT 1996.</title>
<headline>ZWACK BOOSTS PROFIT IN JAN-SEPT 1996.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine-month period ending Sept</p>
<p>30, 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of forints unless stated)</p>
<p>					Jan-Sept 1996    Jan-Sept 1995</p>
<p>    Group operating profit	  676	 vs	544</p>
<p>    Group pre-tax profit	    377	 vs	317</p>
<p>    Gross sales		     9,871	 vs    8,352</p>
<p>    Alcohol tax		     4,097	 vs    3,793</p>
<p>    Net sales			 5,774	 vs    4,559</p>
<p>    Material costs		  3,275	 vs    2,280</p>
<p>    Personnel costs		   774	 vs	659</p>
<p>    Depreciation			216	 vs	147</p>
<p>    Other operating expenses	833	 vs	929</p>
<p>    Financial revenue		  13	 vs	  3</p>
<p>    Financial expenditure	   312	 vs	230</p>
<p>NOTE - Zwack Unicum Rt is a spirits maker group.</p>
<p>The figures are calculated according to International</p>
<p>Accounting Standards.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom (36 1) 327-4040</p>
</text>
